# Grub, Notorious Auntie (CR 701.68a, 707.2, 707.9a, 508.4, 603.7): Grub, transformed on turn 3, attacks and its controller blights a Hill Giant
# (3/3 -> 2/2). The token is a copy of the blighted creature - a 3/3, the -1/-1 counters are not copied (CR 707.2) - created tapped
# and attacking Bot2 without having been declared as an attacker, so Bot2 takes 2 from Grub and 3 from the copy. At the beginning of the
# end step the token is sacrificed, by the ability it has from the copy's exception; the Hill Giant stays, still a 2/2.

